<h1>Both log files carry the trace ID</h1>
<p>With {{ release.tag }}, console records from <code>dekopon-gatewayd</code> and <code>dekopon-brokerd</code> carry <code>trace_id</code> and <code>span_id</code>, with or without a <code>telemetry</code> block. Search both log files for one ID to follow a message from chat to capability decision.</p>
