<h2>Two changes, no new configuration</h2>
<div class="guide-table" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Changes in this release">
<table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Change</th><th scope="col">What you get</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><th scope="row">Trace IDs without an exporter</th><td data-label="What you get">A Mac with no collector can still join a gateway record to the broker decision it caused. The log level stays where you set it.</td></tr>
<tr><th scope="row">Non-DRN wake lines stop the gateway</th><td data-label="What you get">A wake store line whose subject isn't a DRN fails the gateway at start with its line number, as any corrupt line does.</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
</div>
